% arXiv processing directives.
%
% Engine: pdflatex. The document uses the ICLR conference style with the
% times package, both of which expect pdflatex. cmap is loaded so that
% fi and fl ligatures in the T1-encoded Type1 fonts carry ToUnicode
% mappings and the text stays searchable.
%
% iclr2027_conference.sty and .bst are bundled here: TeX Live does not
% ship them, so without them this will not compile.

paper.tex toplevelfile
